1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,660
I knocked on a door
that does not exist.

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:03,220
I'm Mara.

3
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:03,980
I fix signs.

4
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,800
And the signs are warning me.

5
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:08,570
I asked a dead
sign where it was.

6
00:00:08,570 --> 00:00:09,610
It answered.

7
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:09,910
Nine.

8
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:10,410
Nine what?

9
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:10,710
Lives?

10
00:00:10,710 --> 00:00:11,870
I'm down to four.

11
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:12,460
Number nine.

12
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,210
But this street stops at seven.

13
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:15,070
That's us.

14
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,620
Great. It's lying. Bedtime.

15
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,920
Working late, Miss Reyes?

16
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:19,630
Mister Crane.

17
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:21,910
The rent isn't due until Friday.

18
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:23,500
Oh, I'm not here for rent.

19
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,580
I saw your light.

20
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,720
Your mother worked late, too.

21
00:00:26,770 --> 00:00:28,560
What do you know
about my mother?

22
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,440
Only that she would not
stop asking questions.

23
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,450
Sleep well.

24
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:33,330
I hate him.

25
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:35,000
He smells like burnt toast.

26
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:37,190
He walked off, to
where the street ends.

27
00:00:37,190 --> 00:00:38,720
And he never came back.

28
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,130
So we went to look.

29
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:42,460
That wall did not
have a door yesterday.

30
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:43,790
It was nailed shut.

31
00:00:43,790 --> 00:00:45,110
From the inside.

32
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,980
Then please, please
do not knock.

33
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:48,100
I knocked.

34
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:52,210
I would like to go home now.
